1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Actually, sir, this "Detached castling"
strategy you were using

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
is more commonly
known as "Kokoriko."

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
It's one I came up with myself,
about 10 years ago.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
I was so happy that a fool
like me could still give birth

5
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
seeing my dead baby
come back to life.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,000
[King scoffs]

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Rubbish.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
I've lost interest. Take a break.

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
[Komugi] Huh?

10
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
[King] once we begin again…

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Huh?

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
…you will not get any more breaks,

13
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
so be prepared.

14
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,000
[singer singing in English]

15
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

16
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,000
[singer singing in English]

17
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
[upbeat music playing]

18
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,000
RESOLVE X AND X AWAKENING

19
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,000
[thunder rumbling]

20
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
[King] I don't like it.

21
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,000
During our matches,

22
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:48,000
my rhythm is the one
being disrupted, not hers.

23
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:53,000
By all rights, this should be
an unbearable indignity,

24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,000
and yet, although I find
myself frustrated,

25
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Huh?

26
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,000
[tense music playing]

27
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,000
[King] How vile.

28
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,000
She shows no signs
of intelligence or dignity.

29
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:51,000
How do those beautiful plays,
those paragons of logic

30
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Nine-five-one, king.

31
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:31,000
[King] let's make a bet.

32
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:34,000
did you say, "bet"?

33
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,000
[King] I did.

34
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,000
If you win,

35
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,000
I swear that I will give you
anything your heart desires.

36
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Anything? Let me see.

37
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,000
However…

38
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Huh?

39
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,000
If you lose to me,

40
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,000
I'll take your left arm.

41
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
[rain pattering]

42
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
[thunder rumbling]

43
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
[King] Greed and fear
disrupt human rhythm.

44
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:19,000
Greed will cloud the eyes,

45
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:25,000
and fear, fear will cause
courage to shrivel and die.

46
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,000
I bet my life.

47
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,000
but I really
don't want to offend you

48
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,000
right after you made me
such a very generous offer.

49
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,000
But I still don't understand.

50
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Explain yourself.
Whatever do you mean by that?

51
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:33,000
hardly make any money at all,
even national champions.

52
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,000
To become
a national representative,

53
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
you have to win
whole tournaments.

54
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:51,000
That means
that losing even one match

55
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:54,000
is enough to disqualify you.

56
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:25,000
It's just what my parents
have always said.

57
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:32,000
On the day that I set my sights
on playing Gungi professionally,

58
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:36,000
I told myself that I'd die
if I ever lost a match.

59
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:13,000
every second I've got
just thinking about Gungi.

60
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,000
[King] She feels neither fear nor greed.

61
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,000
[chuckles]

62
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
[laughing]

63
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,000
that I was the one
who lacked resolve!

64
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:40,000
-Huh?
-[King] I never imagined

65
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Please, I would never,
ever do such a thing!

66
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:58,000
The thought never once
crossed my mind! I promise!

67
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,000
-[King] I know that.
-[sighs]

68
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,000
This is a personal matter.

69
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,000
No more betting.

70
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:07,000
That was my mistake.

71
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,000
[gasps]

72
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,000
So forgive me.

73
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
[stammers]

74
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,000
Sire! [gasps]

75
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,000
What have you done?

76
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,000
[Shaiapouf] Sire, please,
we must stop the bleeding!

77
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,000
[upbeat music playing]

78
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,000
[King] You heard me.

79
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,000
I said we'll continue playing.

80
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:55,000
I told you that there would be
no more breaks, did I not?

81
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,000
I am certain you will
still be able to play, sire,

82
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:10,000
even as your arm
is being reattached.

83
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,000
That is the biggest concession
I can make.

84
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:19,000
And if you refuse to accept
my offer, take my head

85
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,000
so that I may not live
with the shame of your death.

86
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,000
[whimpering]

87
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Fine, then.

88
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Come closer,
and I will end you with a single strike.

89
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,000
It's your turn to play, so move.

90
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,000
[Komugi] I won't.

91
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:44,000
I refuse to play
until your arm is better.

92
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:46,000
I'm very sorry.

93
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,000
I won't say it again. Now move.

94
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,000
I will not.

95
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:56,000
If you still wish to kill me,
do it in Gungi.

96
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:58,000
[crying]

97
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:02,000
You little-- [groans]

98
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Summon Pitou!

99
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:13,000
Sire.

100
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:18,000
[crying]

101
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:20,000
[thunder rumbling]

102
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,000
[Morel] There's no doubt.

103
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
[Knov] All the puppets are gone.

104
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,000
Have they resumed
the sorting process again?

105
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,000
Doubtful. I would be very surprised.

106
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,000
so they wouldn't go
too far from his side.

107
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,000
Then what's going on?

108
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,000
[Knov] It shouldn't be.

109
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:18,000
They would if the king
had ordered it, wouldn't they?

110
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,000
I suppose so.

111
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
But regardless,
they've already retracted

112
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,000
their long-range
radar detection.

113
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:29,000
While we can, we have to get
as close as possible.

114
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:34,000
If we want this plan to succeed,

115
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,000
I must create an exit
near the palace.

116
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:43,000
We'll have to take this risk
sooner or later.

117
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,000
The time is now.

118
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
[Leol] There. I found them.

119
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,000
Just don't die.

120
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,000
The same to you, Morel.

121
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:11,000
[Leol chuckles]
Good. They've split up.

122
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
[chuckles]

123
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,000
[Neferpitou] Dr. Blythe.

124
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:06,000
[Neferpitou] Hmm. I'd say about two
or three hours to fix it completely.

125
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:10,000
[Shaiapouf] And you can't use
your puppets or En during that time?

126
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:14,000
Mm, this ability
takes an awful lot of Nen, meow.

127
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Since it requires
quite a bit of your energy

128
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,000
Either way,
this is an important task

129
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,000
I cannot trust to anyone else.

130
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
[Knov] There's no evidence
they're using En.

131
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:07,000
We need an exit near the palace,

132
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:10,000
but if I'm spotted, it's all over.

133
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:15,000
While I can freely
come and go as I please,

134
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:18,000
Shoot and the others
can only use the exit to leave

135
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,000
once they enter the mansion.

136
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
I need to prepare three exits--
near, far, and in the middle.

137
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:55,000
That will help us
to keep a close eye on things.

138
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,000
When the time comes,

139
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Once that has been determined,
we'll act.

140
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,000
From the enemy's perspective,

141
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:16,000
we'll seem to appear
before their very eyes.

142
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,000
I feel more dead than alive.

143
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:00,000
But I have a long way to go.

144
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:16,000
Should I wait for the sun to set?

145
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:20,000
That would be ideal, but will
the rain hold out until then?

146
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,000
[groans] I have no choice.

147
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:28,000
Should Neferpitou's En be reactivated,

148
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:31,000
any approach
will be all but impossible.

149
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:38,000
Even if I fail,
we still have other options.

150
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:44,000
Go without fear. Closer.

151
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
[thunder rumbling]

152
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,000
[narrator] Currently in the palace,

153
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:58,000
there are only three humans
the ants do not intend to eat.

154
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:01,000
First is the Gungi player,

155
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:04,000
the second is Diego,

156
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,000
and all dealings with foreign parties

157
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:29,000
and domestic organizations
went through him.

158
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:35,000
This puts him in the unique position
of being irreplaceable,

159
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,000
[narrator] There is not a single
human guard

160
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:45,000
posted anywhere near the palace.

161
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Because ordinary soldiers would
be powerless against Nen users,

162
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:53,000
the royal guard determined that
the presence of human soldiers

163
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:56,000
would increase the risk
of enemy infiltration.

164
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:00,000
Cheetu, who has only just returned,

165
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:03,000
is the only squadron leader
on the premises,

166
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:22,000
the various squadron leaders'
personal favorites, and as such,

167
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:33,000
and his squadron leaders
has vanished entirely.

168
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:37,000
Self-interest was the only thing
keeping them there,

169
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,000
nothing more.

170
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,000
and are expected
to end in failure.

171
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:53,000
Lookout duty would never
be entrusted to the others.

172
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:01,000
but his current attempt
to infiltrate the palace

173
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:28,000
to provide at least three more staffers
to handle the secretarial duties,

174
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,000
I'll die of overwork for sure.

175
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,000
[sighs]

176
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,000
[computer chimes]

177
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,000
Huh?

178
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:39,000
SENDING YOU A LIST
REGARDING FRESH MEAT

179
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:41,000
[tense music playing]

180
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:43,000
Huh?

181
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,000
[laughs]

182
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:15,000
[gasps]

183
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:30,000
"Sinker Bell."

184
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,000
Yes.

185
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:43,000
PER OUR ARRANGEMENT,
I REQUEST NUMBERS 2, 16, 79, 103, AND 119

186
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:55,000
Hey, Palm, got a hit.

187
00:21:57,000 --> 00:22:00,000
[closing theme music playing]

188
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:09,000
Palm is preparing to launch
an infiltration of her own.

189
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:13,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

190
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,000
And look
who's joining me today!

191
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,000
[Knov] Why am I here?

192
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:38,000
[Gon] Because Killua's not around.

193
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
-[Knov] Scream.
-[Gon screams]

194
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
